#. ja: 朽ちた剣【天獄】
#. de: anabaseisch[a] Schwert
#. fr: épée rouillée du Paradis
#. column 2: unsung blades of Anabaseios
#. column 8: A stunning but sadly unstoried blade recovered from Pandæmonium. Though such weapons were once considered highly valuable, demand has dried up and they are now essentially worthless.
#. column 9: Unsung Blade of Anabaseios
msgctxt "Item:40317:0:0"
msgid "unsung blade of Anabaseios"
msgstr ""

#. de: anabaseisch[a] Schwerter
