#. ja: 希少エイコンドライト
#. de: selten[a] Achondrit
#. fr: morceau d'achondrite rarissime
#. column 2: chunks of amplifying achondrite
#. column 8: This hunk of meteorite contains deposits of a rare form of pyroxene. When subjected to an advanced extraction process, the achondrite produces mineral oil which can be used to manipulate the pathways of aetherial conductivity.
#. column 9: Amplifying Achondrite
