#. column 8: Wear these lenses to feel and exude optimism.*<br>* Optimism may or may not be warranted. Please act according to actual conditions. Though these were once considered a fashion accessory, trends are ever changing, and style enthusiasts now classify them as facewear. Use to unlock rose-colored spectacles.
